{"step_index":132,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-21T00:04:57Z","thinking":"A backup of the extracted 318 target companies is available. The next step involves searching for these companies across several specified online resources, including business directories and mapping services. Before proceeding, understanding the search mechanism of one specific directory, Bizno, is essential.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import urllib.request\\nimport urllib.parse\\nimport re\\n\\ndef test_bizno_search(query):\\n    url = f\\\"https://bizno.net/?query={urllib.parse.quote(query)}\\\"\\n    headers = {\\n        \\\"User-Agent\\\": \\\"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/120.0.0.0 Safari/537.36\\\"\\n    }\\n    req = urllib.request.Request(url, headers=headers)\\n    try:\\n        with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=10) as resp:\\n            html = resp.read().decode('utf-8', errors='ignore')\\n            print(f\\\"Status: {resp.status}, HTML length: {len(html)}\\\")\\n            # Look for article links\\n            links = re.findall(r'href=[\\\"\\\\'](/article/\\\\d+)[\\\"\\\\']', html)\\n            print(f\\\"Article links found for '{query}': {links[:5]}\\\")\\n            # Look for titles/names\\n            return html, links\\n    except Exception as e:\\n        print(f\\\"Error for '{query}': {e}\\\")\\n        return None, []\\n\\ntest_bizno_search(\\\"모두싸인\\\")\\ntest_bizno_search(\\\"유비플러스\\\")\\ntest_bizno_search(\\\"아이티에프씨\\\")\\n\"","Description":"\"Test bizno search URL structure\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\cc5f8116-f40f-4d66-a990-d85efe7bc64f\\\\scratch\\\\test_bizno.py\"","toolAction":"\"Writing bizno test script\"","toolSummary":"\"Test Bizno search\""}}]}
