{"step_index":152,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-21T00:05:34Z","thinking":"Examining the provided company data, focusing on details like phone numbers and addresses alongside their listed business types (publishing, advertising). A potential discrepancy emerges: \"녹생광고연합그린하우징\" – needs verification if the correct name is \"녹색광고연합\" or \"녹생광고연합\".\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import urllib.request\\nimport urllib.parse\\nimport re\\nimport json\\nimport time\\n\\ndef search_bizno(name):\\n    # Try searching on bizno\\n    url = f\\\"https://bizno.net/?query={urllib.parse.quote(name)}\\\"\\n    headers = {\\n        \\\"User-Agent\\\": \\\"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/120.0.0.0 Safari/537.36\\\"\\n    }\\n    req = urllib.request.Request(url, headers=headers)\\n    try:\\n        with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=10) as resp:\\n            html = resp.read().decode('utf-8', errors='ignore')\\n            # Extract article links and titles\\n            # Structure: <div class=\\\"titles\\\"> <a href=\\\"/article/(\\\\d+)\\\"><h1>(.*?)</h1></a>\\n            matches = re.findall(r'href=[\\\"\\\\'](/article/(\\\\d+))[\\\"\\\\'][^>]*>[\\\\s\\\\S]*?<h[12][^>]*>(.*?)</h[12]>', html)\\n            \\n            # Also extract snippets\\n            posts = re.findall(r'<div class=\\\"single-post[\\\\s\\\\S]*?</div>\\\\s*</div>\\\\s*</div>', html)\\n            results = []\\n            for m in matches:\\n                link, biz_no, title = m\\n                clean_title = re.sub(r'<[^>]+>', '', title).strip()\\n                results.append({\\\"biz_no\\\": biz_no, \\\"title\\\": clean_title})\\n            return results\\n    except Exception as e:\\n        return []\\n\\ntest_names = [\\\"꿈해몽\\\", \\\"나래바람\\\", \\\"녹생광고연합그린하우징\\\", \\\"동그라미광고공사\\\", \\\"동화사\\\", \\\"라온엔터테인먼트\\\", \\\"메리데브\\\", \\\"무몽크\\\", \\\"모두싸인\\\"]\\n\\nwith open(r\\\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\cc5f8116-f40f-4d66-a990-d85efe7bc64f\\\\scratch\\\\bizno_test_res.txt\\\", \\\"w\\\", encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\") as out:\\n    for name in test_names:\\n        res = search_bizno(name)\\n        out.write(f\\\"Search: '{name}' -> Found {len(res)} results\\\\n\\\")\\n        for r in res[:3]:\\n            out.write(f\\\"   {r['biz_no']} | {r['title']}\\\\n\\\")\\n        time.sleep(1)\\n\\nprint(\\\"Finished bizno test\\\")\\n\"","Description":"\"Test querying bizno with sample company names\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\cc5f8116-f40f-4d66-a990-d85efe7bc64f\\\\scratch\\\\test_query_bizno.py\"","toolAction":"\"Writing bizno query script\"","toolSummary":"\"Test batch query on Bizno\""}}]}
